>
> mu'o mi'e ianek
>
> On Wednesday, April 18, 2012 5:16:49 PM UTC+2, gleki wrote:
>>
>> I suggest optionally replacing existing gismu for tastes with more 
>> meaningful terms.
>>
>> source:http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taste
>>
>> ?                   ka silna -salty
>> titla                ka sakta - sweet
>> slari               ka slami - sour
>> kurki              ka cakla - bitter
>>                      la'oi umami / ka rectu - umami
>>                      se kurtsapi / ka mernta - minty/fresh
>>                      ka tcati - dry
>>                      ka grasu - fatty
>>                      ka xalka - kokumi (alcohol included, so non-neutral)
>>                      ??? - numbness taste
>>                      ka cpina - spicy
>>
